2026-09-24T21:33:35.4451587Z the object
2026-09-24T21:33:35.4452004Z ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2026-09-24T21:33:35.4452847Z   PASS  carriers  -- visible 4 states (site 0's pair), hidden 64 states (sites 1-3)
2026-09-24T21:33:35.4454157Z   PASS  prior normalized  -- uniform 1/64, [Main] Lemma 3's selection -- a selection, not a derivation
2026-09-24T21:33:35.4455253Z   PASS  step is a bijection  -- the transported wave rule permutes the 256 cut states
2026-09-24T21:33:35.4456146Z 
